<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Extreme</strong></div>
    <div><strong>tài</strong> verb-<strong>le</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">太...了</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Do verb for (dative)</strong></div>
    <div>verb + <strong>gěi</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">给</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Try doing (verb)</strong></div>
    <div>verb + <strong>yíxià</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">一下</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Try doing (verb)</strong></div>
    <div>verb + <strong>yi</strong> + verb</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">一</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">喝<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">一</span>喝</div>
    <div>hē-yi-hē</div>
    <div>Try drinking</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Don't do (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>bié</strong> + verb-<strong>le</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">别...(了)</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>More / less of (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>duō / shǎo</strong> + verb</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">多/少</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Negation of (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>bù / méi yǒu</strong> + verb-<strong>le</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">不/没有...(了)</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Progressive (verb)</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>zhe</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">着</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Negative progressive (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>méi (yǒu)</strong> + verb-<strong>zhe</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">没(有)...着</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Past / completed (verb)</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>gùo</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">过</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Negative past / completed (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>méi (yǒu)</strong> + verb-<strong>gùo</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">没(有)...过</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Affirmation / confirmation of ability (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>huì</strong> + verb-<strong>de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">会...的</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Early / late of (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>zǎo / wǎn</strong> + verb</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">早/晚</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Passive of (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>ràng / jiào / bèi</strong> + verb</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">让/叫/被</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">牛奶<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">被</span>猫喝了</div>
    <div>niúnǎi bèi māo hē-le</div>
    <div>milk [object / subject] by cat [agent] drink-[past]</div>
    <div>The milk was drunk by the cat</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Emphasised negation of (verb)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>bìng bù / méi yǒu</strong> + verb-<strong>le</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">并不/没有...(了)</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Particle le</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>le</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">了</span></div>
    <div>1. Change of state – pluperfect</div>
    <div>2. Continuation of state – progressive</div>
    <div>3. Completed future state – perfect future</div>
    <div>4. Habitual past – simple past</div>
</div>
